      path="/hiking/"
      type="article"
      ogTitle="The Ultimate Guide to Hiking in Dinosaur Country"
      ogDescription="Dinosaur National Monument, the High Uintas, Flaming Gorge, and Red Fleet — how to choose where to hike near Vernal, Utah and which trails match your ability."
