      <h2>Seasonal Hiking</h2>
      <p>One of the region's strengths is that <em>something is always good to hike</em>, as long as you match the destination to the season. The single most important rule is to <strong>pair elevation with the calendar</strong>: desert low, mountains high, and let the weather steer you. Here is how the year unfolds.</p>
